# =======================================================================
# data/uploads/ — Uploaded PDF Documents Directory
# =======================================================================
# PURPOSE:
# This directory stores user-uploaded study materials and PDFs processed
# by the backend pipeline.
#
# SENSITIVE DATA & PRIVACY:
# Student lecture notes, textbooks, and personal PDF files placed here
# are strictly private. All files in this directory are excluded from
# Git tracking via .gitignore to prevent accidentally leaking personal
# or copyrighted documents.
#
# INSTRUCTIONS FOR NEW USERS:
# 1. Place your own PDF study files here manually or upload via the API:
#      POST /documents/upload
# 2. Never commit personal or proprietary PDF documents to GitHub.
# 3. Only sample public notes (like 'lec-1.pdf', 'Lec-2.pdf') are tracked
#    for demonstration and test purposes.
# =======================================================================
